# Verify

- `npm test`: unit + SQLite HTTP e2e
- `npm run test:postgres`: same contract on Docker/Testcontainers
- `npm run typecheck`: after a series of backend edits
- `npm run build`: frontend

Do not commit `.env`. After a behaviour change: tests, then `/review` or `/review-security`.
